    "body": "Make the deny-branch preparation produce one real tactical payoff inside the first incoming argument battle.\n\n- if the player showed the evidence to Настя, reveal Райхан's first attack color automatically\n- if the player kept the evidence, expose one one-time `Показать доказательство` action in that battle\n- persist `pending -> revealed|expired`, reveal time, and exactly-once count across refresh\n- restore an already revealed color when the active bridge battle resumes\n- expire unused held evidence after the bridge battle finishes\n- bind the payoff strictly to the stable Stage 7 bridge ID and exact battle ID\n- leave ordinary battles, canonical arguments, conflict economy, and conflict core unchanged\n- update source/docs cache markers and Stage 7 regression contracts\n\nValidation:\n- focused dynamic shared/held/resume/expiry/ordinary-battle harness\n- full Stage 7 regression matrix\n- source/docs JS and index parity\n- Node syntax and `git diff --check`\n- exact ten-file scope\n- no conflict-core/API/economy/data/system mutation\n- no network transmission",
    "changed_files": 10,
